        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mervyn LeRoy, Hal Hartley\n- Works: Surviving Desire\n- Roles: film director, producer, actor, screenwriter, composer\n- Topics: American independent film movement\n\nFacts:\n- Mervyn LeRoy was born on October 15, 1900, and he was an American film director, film producer, and occasional actor.\n- Hal Hartley was born on November 3, 1959, and he is an American film director, screenwriter, producer, and composer.\n- Hal Hartley became a key figure in the American independent film movement of the 1980s and 1990s.\n- Surviving Desire is a 1991 American comedy-drama film written and directed by Hal Hartley.\n- Mervyn LeRoy died on September 13, 1987.",
